cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you reference this work, please cite the team and the IMC Prosperity 4 campaign."
title: "DTU Quant Lab — IMC Prosperity 4 (28th place worldwide)"
abstract: >
  Algorithmic and manual trading strategies developed by team DTU Quant Lab during
  IMC Prosperity 4. The team finished 28th out of 18,803 worldwide, 31st in
  algorithmic trading, 10th in Europe, and 1st in Denmark. This repository
  documents the shipped traders, the per-round PnL, and the academic literature
  consulted (and frequently rejected) along the way.
type: software
